            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.4.27+LEV.4.28+LEV.4.29+LEV.4.30+LEV.4.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 4:27-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kakuba omuntu omu asiisa atagenderiire, aheyo embuzi eruusi enyakuhikize omwaka gumu ebe kihongwa eky'okuganyiza ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyakatagara asabe MUKAMA aganyire omuntu ogu, anyakusobeze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu weena anyakusiisa atagenderiire, ekiragiro kiri kimu, nikikwata abantu boona, abe nzaarwa rundi munyaihanga omwikazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu weena anyakusiisa agenderiire, abe nzaarwa rundi munyaihanga, agaya Ruhanga, ogu asendwege aruge omubantu b'owabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba aba agayire MUKAMA eki yagambire, kandi acwire ekiragiro kye. Omuntu ogu asenderwe kimu; omusango guba gumusingire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omuntu arukucwa ekiragiro kya Sabbato kuteerwa Amabaale",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaana ba Isirairi obu bakaba bakyaali omwirungu, bakasanga omuntu naasenya enku ha kiro kya Sabbato, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abo abaamusangire naasenya, baamuleetera Musa na Arooni, n'ekitebe kyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamuta omu nkomo habwokuba bakaba batamanyire kurungi eki baraamukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yagambira Musa ati: “Omusaija ogu asemeriire aitwe; ekitebe kyoona kimuteere amabaale aheeru y'orukande.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 15:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe kyoona eky'abantu baamutwara aheeru y'orukande, boona baamuteera amabaale, okuhika afiire nkooku MUKAMA yaragiire Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.15.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.15.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abaisirairi nibaragirwa kuta ebitutu ha by'okujwara",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
